a9y18qlte: bgmtl_carenderer_probe: target size and IOSurface switches

backboardd's frames on Chlorophyll stay empty on the A512 (every sampled pixel of its 1125x2436
IOSurface framebuffers (0,0,0,0)), while this probe's 256x256 scenes, through the same
CoreAnimation renderer, come out right. BG_CAR_W / BG_CAR_H set the target size and
BG_CAR_IOSURFACE=1 puts the texture over an IOSurface, so the two can be told apart; pictures are
written only up to 256x256.

Assisted-by: LLM

